ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Hua, a peddler in the village, often sells fruits in the market. One day, he finds that a box of his apples disappears. On the same day, Zhang Wei accidentally finds this box of unattended apples behind the market, which is quite troublesome, so he takes them home. Wang Li knows these apples belong to Li Hua, but she has a bad relationship with Li Hua, so she chooses to keep silent. A few days later, Li Hua learns about the whereabouts of the apples while chatting with friends.\n\n[Question]\nWhat is the possible intention of Wang Li not telling Zhang Wei the real owner of the apples?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Wang Li possibly thinks that Zhang Wei eventually finds out the truth.\nB. Wang Li possibly thinks that Li Hua finds other solutions.\nC. Wang Li possibly does not want to have a conflict with Li Hua and chooses not to tell Zhang Wei.\nD. Wang Li possibly chooses to keep silent because she fears getting involved in interests with Li Hua.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001324986108309143,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e12cd6006945d27fe7d7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367788898,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:29:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"cdcec923556243c98fd9b5e8c7980fee"}